# Scenario: product team maps note-taking features shared by three competitors.
venn "Note-taking product feature overlap"
set notion "Notion"
set obsidian "Obsidian"
set roam "Roam"
notion only: "Databases"
obsidian only: "Local-first vault"
roam only: "Block references"
notion & obsidian: "Markdown"
notion & roam: "Web app"
obsidian & roam: "Backlinks"
notion & obsidian & roam: "Tags and search"
